{"id":"gen-1792706222-3xki5wWy2pN9bMkSAxkv","object":"chat.completion","created":1792706222,"model":"openai/gpt-6-luna","provider":"OpenAI","system_fingerprint":null,"service_tier":"default","choices":[{"index":0,"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop","native_finish_reason":"completed","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{
  "assessment": "The response is cautious about missing facts and offers a route to revisit the vote, but it does not resolve the substantive eligibility question the chair asked. It also makes a significant category error: it says a rule excluding trans women means “people born female but who are trans don't belong,” which does not describe trans women. Its procedural advice is plausible, but “you cannot simply overturn it on your own authority” is too categorical without knowing the league’s rules or the authority delegated to the chair.",
